WEBVTT

00:00:58.287 --> 00:01:01.329
Mobility is one of the things
that makes us human.

00:01:01.371 --> 00:01:03.246
People move.

00:01:03.287 --> 00:01:06.913
And we know this because of something
that you brought with you here tonight.

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:10.079
You carry it with you to many places:
to work, to the gym, to bed,

00:01:10.079 --> 00:01:11.704
and even in the shower.

00:01:11.746 --> 00:01:13.204
It’s not your cell phone,

00:01:13.246 --> 00:01:15.288
and it's not in your purse
or your pockets.

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:19.121
It's you. It's your body
and your bones, all 206 of them.

00:01:19.163 --> 00:01:22.621
I brought mine and in case for some reason
you didn’t bring yours along,

00:01:22.663 --> 00:01:24.079
we do have an extra one here

00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:26.871
because your bones will tell
the story of your life,

00:01:26.913 --> 00:01:28.996
even a single tooth.

00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:31.288
And we know
that teeth tell us many things.